DTSTART:20260603T000000Z
DTEND:20260704T235900Z
SUMMARY:Wild & Wonderful Tablescapes-Celebrating America One Table at a Time
LOCATION:102 E. German Street 
DESCRIPTION:From June 29 through July 4\, The Community Club will host a spectacular display of tablescapes celebrating American culture\, history\, and art.\nThe event will begin on June 29 with a Gala Opening at 7:00 PM. From June 30 through July 4\, the tablescape display will be open to the public.\nTablescaping is a long-standing county fair tradition that originally showcased the art of properly setting a table with formal place settings and centerpieces\, often judged for detail and presentation. In our version\, we’re keeping the spirit of the tradition while focusing on creativity\, imagination\, and celebration rather than formal judging.\nEach tablescape will reflect the richness of America—its history\, achievements\, landscapes\, struggles\, and cultural diversity—brought to life in imaginative and meaningful ways.\nThis event also serves as a Community Club fundraiser. Visitors will be invited to vote for their favorite tablescape by placing donations into specially marked jars. The display receiving the highest total will be awarded Best in Show.\nPlease join us at the Memorial Building to experience these creative and inspiring displays. The exhibit will be open on the second floor daily from 10:00 AM to 6:00 PM\, June 30 through July 4.
CATEGORIES:
ORGANIZATION:Shepherdstown Community Club
URL:https://www.shepherdstowncommunityclub.org/events/wild-wonderful-tablescapes-celebrating-america-one-table-at-a-time
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SOURCE:shepherdstowncommunityclub.org
